# H1 (QUALIFICATION): one eight-user hang shape on the SHIPPING traffic profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix (the stack W1's 5 of 5 hang shapes were read on, plus packed prefix reuse):
# warm-up, four and eight steady, resend, replay at four and eight, the audited-equal code round, the split and the drain. READ: every test
# completes (no host block in execute_trace, no sequential-step watchdog dump), no garbage text, no errored or empty stream, rounds with live=8 seen, no
# program compiled after the warm. H1, H2 and H3 are three runs of one shape, each after a fresh reset. Real time 13-15.
# TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the ship/262k-prefix pack (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over that file on a throwaway
# commit of the integration branch (with its evidence files committed) and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Names no rig, card, host or registry. ORDER.txt has
# the order, stop rules, real minutes, NEEDS and the GO rule. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-10 is the ONE shipping image X0B builds: every job serves it.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-10
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent4_steady,concurrent8_steady,steady_resend,replay_concurrent4,replay_concurrent8,concurrent8_code_equal,concurrent5_split,concurrent8_drain
